{"id":"626460","name":"生拌椒油苤蓝","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/626460/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苤蓝","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"1棵"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜的苤蓝。","img":"images/626460/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去叶子，去皮，清洗干净。","img":"images/626460/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切细丝放入盘中。","img":"images/626460/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香葱切碎放入盘中。","img":"images/626460/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入生抽酱油。","img":"images/626460/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入醋调味。","img":"images/626460/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入白糖中和醋酸。","img":"images/626460/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热油炸香花椒，去掉炸焦的花椒，留下花椒油。","img":"images/626460/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"趁热烹入花椒油。","img":"images/626460/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"葱香味被激发出来。","img":"images/626460/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"吃的时候拌匀即可。","img":"images/626460/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"苤蓝可生食也可熟食。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}